+HRDataset\_v14 uses a separate seven-feature conservative policy, its own nested selection, and five fixed 5×5 repetitions. Models are trained and tuned anew on its 311 records. This is an independently trained mapped-target protocol replication, not transport of a locked INX model (C008). Features, target semantics, parameters, and population differ.
